    Lines:
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: Welcome to the Golden Sheaf. Warm yourself by the hearth, the stew's nearly ready.
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: Your room's up the stairs, the first one past the landing. Rest whenever you like, there's no charge for the shrine's people.
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: The ground shook again last night. Knocked two mugs off the shelf. Strange times.
